{
  "title": "ELB / ALB / NLB · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "하나의 서비스 주소로 들어온 요청을 여러 정상 서버에 분산합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ELB <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Load Balancing)</span> / ALB <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Load Balancer)</span> / NLB <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Load Balancer)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#guide-1\">ALB와 NLB 선택하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#guide-2\">요청을 받을 대상 관리하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>23 / 62</span></div><h1>ELB <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Load Balancing)</span> / ALB <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Load Balancer)</span> / NLB <span class=\"full-name\">(Network Load Balancer)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Elastic Load Balancing은 <strong>사용자의 연결을 여러 서버나 처리 대상으로 분산하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 사용자는 하나의 진입점으로 접속하고, 로드 밸런서는 상태가 정상인 대상에 요청을 보냅니다.</p><p>서버를 추가하거나 교체해도 서비스 진입점을 유지할 수 있습니다. 처리할 통신의 종류에 따라 ALB 또는 NLB 등을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"application-load-balancer\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"network-load-balancer\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"gateway-load-balancer\"></span><h2>ALB와 NLB 선택하기</h2><p><strong>ALB</strong>는 HTTP·HTTPS 웹 요청을 처리합니다. URL 경로나 도메인 이름을 기준으로 요청을 서로 다른 대상에 보낼 수 있어 웹 애플리케이션과 API에 적합합니다.</p><p><strong>NLB</strong>는 TCP·UDP 등 네트워크 연결을 처리합니다. 고성능 연결 처리나 고정 IP가 필요한 상황에서 검토합니다. 방화벽 같은 네트워크 장비로 트래픽을 전달하는 용도에는 Gateway Load Balancer를 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"classic-load-balancer\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"listeners-and-target-groups\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"internet-facing-and-internal\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cross-zone-load-balancing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"tls-stickiness-and-deregistration\"></span><h2>요청을 받을 대상 관리하기</h2><p>리스너<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>는 받을 포트와 프로토콜을, 대상 그룹은 요청을 처리할 서버 등을 정의합니다. 상태 확인에 실패한 대상에는 일반적인 정상 대상 분산 과정에서 요청을 보내지 않습니다.</p><p>인터넷 공개용인지 내부 서비스용인지 선택하고 여러 AZ에 배치합니다. HTTPS에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM 인증서</a>를 연결하며, 사용자와 로드 밸런서 사이 및 뒤쪽 서버와의 통신 설정을 각각 정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>로드 밸런서의 요청 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>사용자 요청</strong><span>하나의 서비스 주소</span></li><li><strong>로드 밸런서</strong><span>규칙·정상 상태 확인</span></li><li><strong>대상 그룹</strong><span>여러 서버가 요청 처리</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">서버 수가 바뀌어도 사용자는 같은 서비스 진입점으로 접속합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>같은 도메인의 <code>/api</code> 요청은 API 서버 그룹으로, <code>/images</code> 요청은 이미지 서버 그룹으로 보냅니다. HTTP 경로를 구분하는 ALB 규칙을 사용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>리스너</strong> — 로드 밸런서가 연결 요청을 기다리는 포트와 프로토콜 설정입니다. 요청을 어떤 대상 그룹으로 보낼지 정하는 규칙과 연결됩니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/userguide/what-is-load-balancing.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Elastic Load Balancing? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q024\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q033\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q033\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q033</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q033/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service requires TCP connections and fixed IP addresses but does not need HTTP path routing. Which load balancer should be considered first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q033\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a>는 L4 TCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Transmission Control Protocol)</span>/UDP <span class=\"full-name\">(User Datagram Protocol)</span> 연결 요구와 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 요구에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q066\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q066\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q066</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q066/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter SQL injection patterns and excessive HTTP requests before they reach an ALB. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS STS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q066\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>가 웹 요청의 규칙·속도 기반 필터링에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1,2\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q084\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q084\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q097\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q097\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q097</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q097/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An ALB must terminate browser HTTPS connections using a certificate that is issued and renewed as a managed service. What should be attached?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q097\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ACM certificate</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a> 같은 통합 서비스에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a> 인증서를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">이전 용어 <b>ElastiCache</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">다음 용어 <b>ENI</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
